WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.841 --> 00:00:16.528
The next morning Zann took his friends to his parents' lab for a tour.

2
00:00:17.568 --> 00:00:20.890
Perda wanted to see where they worked and check out their latest inventions.

3
00:00:21.851 --> 00:00:23.192
Saffa decided to go too.

4
00:00:26.714 --> 00:00:29.556
When they arrived, they found Boz there with Zann's parents.

5
00:00:31.076 --> 00:00:32.557
"Would you like to see the relics?"

6
00:00:32.898 --> 00:00:34.259
Asta asked Zann's friends.

7
00:00:34.279 --> 00:00:36.680
"Sure," Perda said.

8
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.042
"Is the Mask of Zanta here?"

9
00:00:39.062 --> 00:00:42.805
"You already saw that," Gliss reminded her.

10
00:00:42.825 --> 00:00:47.348
"That was when it was lying around in the Cave of the Unknown," Perda said.

11
00:00:47.368 --> 00:00:49.930
"Seeing it here is different."

12
00:00:51.111 --> 00:00:53.673
Zann followed his mother and his friends into the next room.

13
00:00:53.693 --> 00:00:58.236
"Wow," Gliss said when Asta showed them the Mask of Zanta.

14
00:00:59.144 --> 00:01:00.725
It was locked in a glass case.

15
00:01:00.745 --> 00:01:03.427
"That's amazing.

16
00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:05.668
And kind of scary."

17
00:01:05.688 --> 00:01:12.952
"We keep this relic separate from the others, since it's probably the strongest one we found," Zann's mother

18
00:01:12.992 --> 00:01:16.334
said. "Other than the Horn of the Otherworld, maybe.

19
00:01:16.654 --> 00:01:18.195
But that was destroyed."

20
00:01:19.315 --> 00:01:23.698
Zann shuddered, remembering how Morb had tried to take over Magica with the Horn.

21
00:01:24.678 --> 00:01:27.120
They moved on to the other relics waiting to be cataloged.

22
00:01:28.184 --> 00:01:30.845
Zann's mother even took out a few for the kids to touch.

23
00:01:31.946 --> 00:01:37.649
None of the other relics were as powerful as the Mask of Zanta, but still, Zann felt ancient

24
00:01:37.829 --> 00:01:39.450
magic crackling around them.

25
00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:41.971
"What are you going to do with them?"

26
00:01:42.211 --> 00:01:44.732
Perda asked, examining an old, cracked cup.

27
00:01:44.752 --> 00:01:48.514
"Are you still planning to destroy them all?"

28
00:01:49.654 --> 00:01:51.135
"We're not sure yet."

29
00:01:52.096 --> 00:01:52.776
Asta sighed.

30
00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:59.942
"Most members of the Red Council would prefer that the relics weren't around, in case someone like Morb

31
00:02:00.002 --> 00:02:02.582
ever tries to use them for evil purposes.

32
00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:06.544
But a few members think we should keep some relics."

33
00:02:06.564 --> 00:02:08.484
"Like Venna?"

34
00:02:08.784 --> 00:02:09.424
Zann guessed.

35
00:02:10.465 --> 00:02:14.086
The head of the Red Council had been opposed to destroying the relics all along.

36
00:02:15.306 --> 00:02:19.287
She wanted to store them away in case the items' strong magic was ever needed.

37
00:02:19.307 --> 00:02:21.948
"I see why she thinks that."

38
00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.522
Perda carefully set down the relic she was holding.

39
00:02:24.542 --> 00:02:30.427
"If someone as strong as Morb does come along, the relics could help us fight him."

40
00:02:32.169 --> 00:02:33.190
Zann's mother nodded.

41
00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.712
"Yes, that's Venna's argument," she said.

42
00:02:35.732 --> 00:02:40.216
"But my father and a few others believe it's not worth the risk.

43
00:02:41.317 --> 00:02:44.099
They think—oh, hello, Mari."

44
00:02:45.341 --> 00:02:46.782
Mari had just entered the room.

45
00:02:47.683 --> 00:02:48.944
She was holding another relic.

46
00:02:50.004 --> 00:02:53.928
"Hi," she said, looking surprised to see so many people in the lab.

47
00:02:53.948 --> 00:02:55.729
"Excuse me.

48
00:02:55.749 --> 00:02:57.211
I didn't mean to interrupt."

49
00:02:57.231 --> 00:02:59.172
"No, it's okay."

50
00:02:59.473 --> 00:03:00.393
Zann stepped forward.

51
00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:04.397
"This is Mari, a friend from my new school," he told the others.

52
00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:08.901
"Mari, these are my friends from home—Perda, Darb, and Gliss."

53
00:03:09.902 --> 00:03:10.703
Mari smiled.

54
00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:11.844
"Nice to meet you."

55
00:03:11.864 --> 00:03:14.326
"Same here," Gliss said.

56
00:03:14.346 --> 00:03:16.468
"Are you coming to the party?"

57
00:03:19.668 --> 00:03:20.789
"Oops!" Zann said.

58
00:03:20.809 --> 00:03:22.771
"I've been meaning to invite you.

59
00:03:23.111 --> 00:03:25.413
It's this afternoon, but I'd love for you to come."

60
00:03:26.474 --> 00:03:27.615
He smiled sheepishly.

61
00:03:27.635 --> 00:03:29.117
"Sorry for the late notice."

62
00:03:30.158 --> 00:03:31.599
"That's okay," Mari said.

63
00:03:31.619 --> 00:03:33.461
"I think I can come.

64
00:03:34.061 --> 00:03:35.142
Thanks for the invitation."

65
00:03:36.343 --> 00:03:39.726
She set down the relic she was holding and followed them back into the main room.

66
00:03:40.747 --> 00:03:45.892
Boz and Saffa were leaning over one of Nax's inventions while he explained how it worked.

67
00:03:47.724 --> 00:03:48.564
"What is that?"

68
00:03:48.784 --> 00:03:49.705
Perda hurried over.

69
00:03:49.725 --> 00:03:52.006
"It looks interesting!"

70
00:03:52.986 --> 00:03:53.987
Nax smiled at her.

71
00:03:54.007 --> 00:03:55.527
"I call it the guidelink.

72
00:03:56.608 --> 00:03:59.289
It will help people travel through the vortex more easily."

73
00:04:00.669 --> 00:04:02.290
Just then the door flew open.

74
00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:06.852
Zann was shocked to see the king and queen of Magica rush in.

75
00:04:07.872 --> 00:04:12.734
Right behind them was Venna, followed by a Red, a man whom Zann had never seen before.

76
00:04:13.815 --> 00:04:17.076
Zann's friends also looked shocked by the sight of the king and queen.

77
00:04:17.944 --> 00:04:18.724
"Who's that guy?"

78
00:04:18.965 --> 00:04:19.605
Darb whispered.

79
00:04:20.525 --> 00:04:21.506
"He looks familiar."

80
00:04:21.526 --> 00:04:24.707
"I don't know," Zann whispered back.

81
00:04:24.727 --> 00:04:31.210
"Good! You're all here," the queen said, staring at Boz, Saffa, and Zann's parents.

82
00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:34.171
Then she spotted Zann and the other kids.

83
00:04:34.431 --> 00:04:35.992
"Oh! Hello, youngsters."

84
00:04:36.012 --> 00:04:40.514
"We need to talk," Venna told the other adults, ignoring the kids.

85
00:04:40.534 --> 00:04:42.315
"It's important."

86
00:04:43.575 --> 00:04:45.256
The king rubbed his fingers together.

87
00:04:46.424 --> 00:04:48.025
"I'll zap us all to the palace.

88
00:04:48.606 --> 00:04:49.747
It will be private there."

89
00:04:49.767 --> 00:04:51.348
"All right."

90
00:04:51.748 --> 00:04:54.750
Zann's mother rubbed her hands together and stepped toward the king.

91
00:04:55.771 --> 00:04:57.532
Then she widened her eyes.

92
00:04:57.552 --> 00:05:00.874
"Oh! Some of the relics are still out."

93
00:05:00.894 --> 00:05:03.536
"I'll take care of them," Mari said.

94
00:05:03.556 --> 00:05:06.078
"Thanks, Mari," Asta said.

95
00:05:06.098 --> 00:05:08.700
"I'm sure we'll be back soon."

96
00:05:09.821 --> 00:05:11.222
The adults zapped away.

97
00:05:11.242 --> 00:05:14.504
"I wonder what's going on," Gliss said.

98
00:05:15.352 --> 00:05:16.353
Perda rubbed her chin.

99
00:05:16.373 --> 00:05:18.754
"I'm wondering the same thing," she said.

100
00:05:18.774 --> 00:05:22.516
"Do you think they're talking about what to do with the relics?"

101
00:05:23.677 --> 00:05:25.098
"I doubt it," Zann said.

102
00:05:25.118 --> 00:05:28.120
"They've been talking about that for months.

103
00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:29.761
This seemed urgent."

104
00:05:29.781 --> 00:05:34.123
"Maybe it's about the Void rights protests," Gliss suggested.

105
00:05:34.143 --> 00:05:36.505
"Why would that be urgent?"

106
00:05:36.665 --> 00:05:37.285
Perda asked.

107
00:05:37.305 --> 00:05:41.768
"Boz says Laddno is stirring up too much unrest," Zann said.

108
00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:46.842
"He thinks the protests are turning people against the Red Council, and Reds in general."

109
00:05:48.002 --> 00:05:49.083
"Wow, really?"

110
00:05:49.363 --> 00:05:50.443
Perda looked surprised.

111
00:05:51.584 --> 00:05:52.544
Mari cleared her throat.

112
00:05:54.285 --> 00:05:55.526
"Excuse me," she said.

113
00:05:55.546 --> 00:05:58.207
"I'd better go take care of those relics."

114
00:05:59.307 --> 00:06:00.488
She hurried into the other room.

115
00:06:00.508 --> 00:06:04.009
"She seems nice," Gliss said.

116
00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:07.130
Perda wandered over to pick up the guidelink.

117
00:06:07.871 --> 00:06:09.772
"Do you think this really works?"

118
00:06:10.132 --> 00:06:10.492
she said.

119
00:06:11.372 --> 00:06:13.014
"Maybe we should test it out."

120
00:06:14.034 --> 00:06:15.035
"What do you mean?"

121
00:06:15.376 --> 00:06:17.157
Gliss' eyes widened nervously.

122
00:06:18.158 --> 00:06:18.779
Perda laughed.

123
00:06:19.579 --> 00:06:20.981
"I'm just kidding.

124
00:06:21.981 --> 00:06:25.264
But Zann's dad wants Darb to try out his other invention, right?

125
00:06:26.265 --> 00:06:28.127
It would be fun to try this one too.

126
00:06:29.368 --> 00:06:31.229
I'd love to see more worlds!"

127
00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.312
"Not me," Gliss declared.

128
00:06:34.332 --> 00:06:38.276
"I never want to see the inside of the vortex again!"

129
00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:43.745
Zann took the guidelink from Perda and put it on a shelf.

130
00:06:43.765 --> 00:06:47.010
"Let's go home and get ready for my party."

131
00:06:47.931 --> 00:06:50.455
He glanced at the spot where the adults had zapped away.

132
00:06:50.475 --> 00:06:55.262
"I just hope my parents and Boz get back from the palace in time."
